[32m+[m[32m# E-Commerce Microservices v2 — System Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAn event-driven e-commerce microservices application built using Java 25, Spring Boot, Spring Cloud Gateway, RabbitMQ, and Redis.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe system demonstrates synchronous REST communication, asynchronous event-driven messaging, payment idempotency, inventory concurrency protection, and failure handling.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## High-Level Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```mermaid[m
[32m+[m[32mflowchart TB[m
[32m+[m[32m    Client["Client"][m
[32m+[m[32m    Gateway["API Gateway :8080"][m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    User["User Service :8081"][m
[32m+[m[32m    Order["Order Service :8082"][m
[32m+[m[32m    Product["Product Service :8083"][m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Rabbit[("RabbitMQ - order.events")][m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Payment["Payment Service"][m
[32m+[m[32m    Notification["Notification Service"][m
[32m+[m[32m    Audit["Audit Service"][m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Redis[("Redis - Idempotency")][m
[32m+[m[32m    DLX[("Payment DLX")][m
[32m+[m[32m    DLQ[("Payment DLQ")][m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Client --> Gateway[m
[32m+[m[32m    Gateway --> User[m
[32m+[m[32m    Gateway --> Order[m
[32m+[m[32m    Gateway --> Product[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Order <-->|"REST / RestClient"| Product[m
[32m+[m[32m    Order -->|"ORDER_CREATED"| Rabbit[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Rabbit --> Payment[m
[32m+[m[32m    Rabbit --> Notification[m
[32m+[m[32m    Rabbit --> Audit[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m    Payment <-->|"Event state"| Redis[m
[32m+[m[32m    Payment --> DLX --> DLQ[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Service Responsibilities[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Service | Responsibility |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---|[m
[32m+[m[32m| API Gateway | Centralized API routing |[m
[32m+[m[32m| User Service | User-related APIs |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Product Service | Product information and stock reservation |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Order Service | Order creation and business logic |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Payment Service | Payment event processing and idempotency |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Notification Service | Order event consumption |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Audit Service | Order event auditing |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Communication Patterns[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Synchronous Communication[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOrder Service communicates with Product Service using Spring RestClient.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Asynchronous Communication[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOrder Service publishes `ORDER_CREATED` events to the RabbitMQ topic exchange `order.events`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe event is routed to:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `payment.queue`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `notification.queue`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `audit.queue`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Redis Idempotency[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPayment Service uses Redis to maintain event-processing states.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mKey format:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m`payment:event:{eventId}`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAtomic `SET NX` is used to claim an event before processing.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDuplicate event deliveries are skipped when the event has already been claimed.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Payment Failure Handling[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Configured retry with exponential backoff.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Configured `payment.dlx`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Configured `payment.dlq`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Implemented a DLQ replay service.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Inventory Concurrency[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mProduct Service provides synchronized stock reservation and release operations.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mInsufficient stock returns HTTP 409 Conflict.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Current limitation:** Synchronization protects a single Product Service instance. It is not distributed locking or database-level concurrency control.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Technology Stack[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mJava 25 · Spring Boot 4.1.1 · Spring Cloud Gateway · RabbitMQ 4 · Redis 7 · Docker · Maven[m
[32m+[m
