[32m+[m[32m## 7. Implemented but Not Yet Fully Validated[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Full retry-to-DLQ-to-replay lifecycle.[m
[32m+[m[32m- End-to-end failure recovery.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Distributed inventory concurrency across multiple service instances.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 8. Known Limitations[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Inventory is stored in memory.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Stock reservation synchronization is single-instance only.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Payment processing is simulated.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Orders are not database-persisted.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Transactional Outbox Pattern is not implemented.[m
